#: ../../source/async_CHANGELOG.md:46
msgid "The `async`/`await` release!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/async_CHANGELOG.md:48
msgid ""
"There are a lot of new features and subtle breaking changes in this major"
" version, but the biggest feature is that most Async methods return a "
"Promise if you omit the callback, meaning you can `await` them from "
"within an `async` function."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/async_CHANGELOG.md:57
msgid "Breaking Changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/async_CHANGELOG.md:58
msgid ""
"Most Async methods return a Promise when the final callback is omitted, "
"making them `await`-able! (#1572)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/async_CHANGELOG.md:59
msgid ""
"We are now making heavy use of ES2015 features, this means we have "
"dropped out-of-the-box support for Node 4 and earlier, and many old "
"versions of browsers. (#1541, #1553)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/async_CHANGELOG.md:60
msgid ""
"In `queue`, `priorityQueue`, `cargo` and `cargoQueue`, the "
"\"event\"-style methods, like `q.drain` and `q.saturated` are now methods"
" that register a callback, rather than properties you assign a callback "
"to.  They are now of the form `q.drain(callback)`.  If you do not pass a "
"callback a Promise will be returned for the next occurrence of the event,"
" making them `await`-able, e.g. `await q.drain()`.  (#1586, #1641)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/async_CHANGELOG.md:61
msgid ""
"Calling `callback(false)` will cancel an async method, preventing further"
" iteration and callback calls.  This is useful for preventing memory "
"leaks when you break out of an async flow by calling an outer callback. "
"(#1064, #1542)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/async_CHANGELOG.md:62
msgid ""
"`during` and `doDuring` have been removed, and instead `whilst`, "
"`doWhilst`, `until` and `doUntil` now have asynchronous `test` functions."
" (#850, #1557)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/async_CHANGELOG.md:63
msgid ""
"`limits` of less than 1 now cause an error to be thrown in queues and "
"collection methods. (#1249, #1552)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/async_CHANGELOG.md:64
msgid "`memoize` no longer memoizes errors (#1465, #1466)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/async_CHANGELOG.md:65
msgid ""
"`applyEach`/`applyEachSeries` have a simpler interface, to make them more"
" easily type-able.  It always returns a function that takes in a single "
"callback argument.  If that callback is omitted, a promise is returned, "
"making it awaitable. (#1228, #1640)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/async_CHANGELOG.md:67 ../../source/async_CHANGELOG.md:175
msgid "New Features"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/async_CHANGELOG.md:68
msgid "Async generators are now supported in all the Collection methods. (#1560)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/async_CHANGELOG.md:69
msgid ""
"Added `cargoQueue`, a queue with both `concurrency` and `payload` size "
"parameters. (#1567)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/async_CHANGELOG.md:70
msgid ""
"Queue objects returned from `queue` now have a `Symbol.iterator` method, "
"meaning they can be iterated over to inspect the current list of items in"
" the queue. (#1459, #1556)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/async_CHANGELOG.md:71
msgid ""
"A ESM-flavored `async.mjs` is included in the `async` package.  This is "
"described in the `package.json` `\"module\"` field, meaning it should be "
"automatically used by Webpack and other compatible bundlers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/async_CHANGELOG.md:74
msgid "Better handle arbitrary error objects in `asyncify` (#1568, #1569)"
msgstr ""

